      "fails_assertion": { "op": "equal", "pointer": "/local_agent_id", "value": null },
      "why": "The join is unproven, yet the row names a local agent — attributing a platform run to a session on this machine on the strength of a name or timestamp match. Verified correlation is the only thing that may populate this field."
